  "description": "DIGQER crystallizes in the orthorhombic crystal system with space group C m c 21. Reported CIF formula moiety: C52 H45 Dy4 N36 O5 3+,1.5(C2 H3 N1),3(H2 O1),3(Cl1 1-). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 3 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 3 O neighbors; Dy1A (Dy) has 3 O neighbors; Dy2A (Dy) has 3 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.656-5.220 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 86.97-169.72°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [(L2-H)3(L2)Dy4(N3)4(O)]Cl3(H2O)3(CH3CN)1.5. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 3 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
